      "url": "https://ai.google.dev/docs/gemini_api_overview",
      "snippet": "The Gemini API gives you access to Google's latest large language models. Gemini models are designed for multimodal input, so you can pass in text, images, audio, and video. This page provides an overview of the Gemini API, including its features, capabilities, and how to use it. It also includes information about new features planned for 2024 and 2025, such as enhanced image generation capabilities, improved multimodal understanding, and expanded language support. The API will also introduce new safety features and more granular control over model behavior."
