      "snippet": "In December 2023, we announced the initial release of image generation capabilities within the Gemini API. This allows developers to generate images from text prompts. We are continuously working to improve these features, with plans for significant updates in 2024 and 2025. These updates will include higher resolution image generation, more diverse artistic styles, and the ability to generate images based on multimodal inputs (e.g., text and an existing image). We are also exploring features like inpainting and outpainting."
    },
